{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24175","headline":"早春忆苏州寄梦得 · 白居易","name":"早春忆苏州寄梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴苑四时风景好，就中偏好是春天。\n霞光曙後殷於火，水色晴来嫩似烟。\n士女笙歌宜月下，使君金紫称花前。\n诚知欢乐堪留恋，其奈离乡已四年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}